WEBVTT

00:05.100 --> 00:06.470
HARÉ+GUU

00:07.470 --> 00:10.410
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

00:10.970 --> 00:14.030
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

00:14.680 --> 00:17.580
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

00:18.180 --> 00:21.150
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

00:21.790 --> 00:24.950
Mekurumeku koshitsuki MUCHO

00:25.390 --> 00:28.410
Kodomo nya kiwadoi AMIGO

00:28.990 --> 00:32.090
Kisu shitara suikomaresou

00:32.600 --> 00:35.260
Kowai mono mitasa TONIGHT

00:36.130 --> 00:38.240
Ojikeduitara dame

00:38.240 --> 00:39.700
Oshite osarete GOING

00:39.700 --> 00:41.810
Dokkiri kibun ga iine

00:41.810 --> 00:43.510
Chakkari asa made DANCING

00:43.510 --> 00:45.440
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.440 --> 00:48.810
TROPICANA

00:50.580 --> 00:53.670
Yashi no kokage de tsukamaete

00:54.350 --> 00:57.620
Jirashite tokoton tokoton

00:57.920 --> 01:00.950
Gomen ne anata wa mou toriko

01:01.530 --> 01:04.860
Nigerarenai Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:05.360 --> 01:08.230
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

01:08.800 --> 01:11.860
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

01:12.300 --> 01:15.400
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

01:16.010 --> 01:18.340
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:18.640 --> 01:21.850
HARÉ+GUU

01:21.850 --> 01:21.910
Morning Smooch

01:21.910 --> 01:26.820
Morning Smooch

01:26.880 --> 01:28.440
Good morning!

01:32.220 --> 01:32.810
Hey!

01:36.560 --> 01:38.790
Haré, Guu, morning!

01:42.230 --> 01:43.860
M-Morning.

01:44.030 --> 01:46.530
The sky is clear,
but there's a "kumo" (cloud/spider)!

01:51.510 --> 01:52.600
Just kidding!

01:52.680 --> 01:54.800
Was it funny? Of course it was!

02:01.450 --> 02:04.010
Guu, was it funny?
Was it funny? Say something.

02:05.560 --> 02:06.250
Shut up.

02:12.530 --> 02:14.520
Guu, you say funny things!

02:17.100 --> 02:18.030
Y-You think so?

02:18.570 --> 02:20.540
That's the best! I can laugh so much!

02:21.670 --> 02:23.730
Somebody shut Wadi up!

02:23.970 --> 02:25.700
Geez, I can't take a nap.

02:32.850 --> 02:33.680
I shut him up.

02:33.950 --> 02:35.380
O-Okay.

02:39.460 --> 02:42.080
And so, that ends first period.

02:50.130 --> 02:51.430
Did you watch that TV show yesterday?

02:51.530 --> 02:52.630
Yeah, I sure did.

02:53.140 --> 02:54.140
You know, you know...

02:54.140 --> 02:56.610
That yawn that our teacher just made,
that was funny!

03:16.690 --> 03:18.890
Hey, those in charge of
cleaning up need to stay behind.

03:19.360 --> 03:23.590
Today, that's
Haré, Marie, Toposte, Gupta, and Guu.

03:25.000 --> 03:27.200
Now, pick straws
to see where you're cleaning up.

03:28.000 --> 03:28.840
So...

03:28.840 --> 03:30.500
...we're stuck cleaning the bathroom.

03:31.370 --> 03:33.930
Yay, I'm cleaning the classroom
together with Haré!

03:34.140 --> 03:35.080
That means...

03:36.810 --> 03:38.540
I'm with Guu!

03:39.980 --> 03:42.110
Of all the combinations, that one?

03:42.650 --> 03:43.890
What's wrong Haré?

03:43.890 --> 03:45.750
Are you worried about something, or not?
Which is it?

03:46.220 --> 03:47.710
Oh, it's nothing.

03:48.660 --> 03:50.230
I might be worrying too much.

03:50.230 --> 03:52.790
In the first place, I'm not Guu's guardian or
anything.

03:53.330 --> 03:54.960
Don't slack off, and clean up.

03:55.100 --> 03:56.290
See ya.

03:57.200 --> 03:58.060
Okay.

03:58.130 --> 03:59.690
Guu, did you see our teacher yawn?

04:06.110 --> 04:07.300
Let's see...

04:07.540 --> 04:09.340
Where are you guys in charge of?

04:10.280 --> 04:12.080
At the least, if I can keep an eye on them...

04:13.250 --> 04:15.380
Why do you always ask
where I'm going to be?

04:15.650 --> 04:17.180
W-Why? Well...

04:17.250 --> 04:18.380
Are you pretending to be my guardian?

04:18.460 --> 04:19.420
Y-You know!

04:19.520 --> 04:21.350
You don't know the least bit of how I feel!

04:21.420 --> 04:23.390
If I had the choice, I would never be asking!

04:24.560 --> 04:27.000
We've got the easiest one,
the area behind the main building!

04:27.060 --> 04:29.030
Are you jealous?
We're going to goof off so much!

04:31.430 --> 04:33.730
Behind the main building?
Man, that's far away.

04:34.200 --> 04:36.800
Now, let's hurry up, and fool around a lot!

04:39.880 --> 04:42.850
W-What was up with that laugh?

04:44.810 --> 04:46.580
Haré, let's hurry up with the cleaning.

04:46.780 --> 04:47.580
Y-Yeah.

04:48.180 --> 04:51.240
Guu, if I'm not around, gets really extreme
with what she does.

04:51.860 --> 04:54.380
If Wadi's laugh doesn't stop...

04:55.090 --> 04:55.890
She might beat him down...

04:55.990 --> 04:57.520
...or swallow him whole...

04:58.430 --> 04:59.400
...or...

05:00.660 --> 05:01.430
What's wrong, Haré?

05:02.570 --> 05:03.120
Haré?

05:04.730 --> 05:07.230
Oh, no,
I was just worried about Wadi and Guu.

05:07.300 --> 05:10.530
You know, Guu doesn't seem to be getting
along with Wadi all that much.

05:10.610 --> 05:13.700
So I was worried that Guu might lose her
temper and something might happen.

05:16.610 --> 05:17.580
I see...

05:19.650 --> 05:21.780
You've been acting strange lately, Haré.

05:21.920 --> 05:22.850
S-Strange?

05:23.720 --> 05:25.450
You're hiding something.

05:25.520 --> 05:27.080
Or rather, you act panicked
in a strange way...

05:28.860 --> 05:31.590
That's right, from right around when Guu
first came here...

05:34.430 --> 05:36.400
Now, answer me honestly.

05:36.470 --> 05:39.130
Is Guu the reason
why you've been acting funny, Haré?

05:40.740 --> 05:42.800
Man, she sure hit the target on this one.

05:43.110 --> 05:45.040
What should I do? Should I answer
honestly?

05:45.110 --> 05:46.800
That I'm worried about how strange Guu is?

05:46.880 --> 05:50.570
But, if I said such a thing, wouldn't I end up
getting Marie involved in all of this?

05:51.010 --> 05:53.610
But this is a chance for me to have someone
listen to my worries.

05:55.550 --> 05:57.380
So that's how you really feel about Guu.

05:57.690 --> 05:59.050
Yeah, that's right.

06:00.260 --> 06:02.690
I'll tell you everything,
so can you be my confidante?

06:03.130 --> 06:04.530
Oh, so that's how it is.

06:04.790 --> 06:07.420
Let's see, where should I start?
It's a rather long story.

06:07.500 --> 06:09.900
It's all right, you don't have to tell me
everything. I know.

06:10.530 --> 06:11.560
I know!

06:12.300 --> 06:13.860
You're kidding! You knew?

06:14.740 --> 06:18.570
Marie, you dummy, don't cry...

06:20.340 --> 06:23.740
But it's all right.
You two are a good couple.

06:25.720 --> 06:27.770
Ah, I guess that's one love lost.

06:27.850 --> 06:29.320
Wha-!? What's with a love lost?

06:29.390 --> 06:30.510
What are you talking about?

06:30.590 --> 06:31.950
Why are you looking up with
tears welling up in your eyes?

06:32.190 --> 06:35.020
It's all right. Don't worry about me.

06:35.230 --> 06:36.320
I'll be cheering you on!

06:36.690 --> 06:39.420
W-Wait a minute! There's some giant
misunderstanding going on here!

06:39.860 --> 06:41.420
All right, if that's the case,
things will be quick.

06:41.500 --> 06:43.260
We have to ditch this
cleaning and go after Guu!

06:43.370 --> 06:46.390
You know... Imagining... Marie, you're
imagining things!

06:46.570 --> 06:49.230
Love never blossoms if you can't be
assertive enough to imagine!

06:49.310 --> 06:50.330
Attack! Attack!

06:50.610 --> 06:53.370
That's not it! Marie, you've got it wrong!

06:54.980 --> 06:55.970
Oh, there they are.

06:59.820 --> 07:02.380
I'm glad. Nothing's happened yet.

07:02.790 --> 07:05.220
What are you going to do, Haré? Are you
going to go out there and confess your love?

07:06.160 --> 07:07.350
Yes! That's the best option.

07:07.420 --> 07:08.950
Do it! Come on, hurry up!

07:09.090 --> 07:11.690
As I've been saying,
you've got the wrong idea!

07:12.400 --> 07:13.050
Wrong?

07:13.160 --> 07:15.190
Yes! I've been telling you over and over.

07:15.270 --> 07:17.630
I don't think anything of Guu at all!

07:20.000 --> 07:20.730
Haré...

07:22.040 --> 07:22.900
You liar.

07:23.970 --> 07:27.240
Haré, you're such a kind liar!

07:33.250 --> 07:36.150
Marie... How can I convince her?

07:42.330 --> 07:44.990
Hey, Guu, why don't you laugh?

07:45.860 --> 07:47.730
You always look so bored.

07:50.170 --> 07:52.600
Don't say anything
that would get Guu mad, Wadi.

07:53.200 --> 07:54.970
Is there something good if I laugh?

07:55.340 --> 07:56.830
Guu is having a normal conversation.

07:58.540 --> 07:59.300
Of course there is!

07:59.380 --> 08:02.040
You see, if you laugh, you can have fun!

08:02.280 --> 08:03.440
That's the opposite! The opposite!

08:03.510 --> 08:05.640
You normally laugh
because you're having fun!

08:05.850 --> 08:10.290
And if you laugh,
troubles and stuff fly away sometimes!

08:10.490 --> 08:11.950
Oh, that's amazing.

08:12.290 --> 08:13.590
Guu, you should try laughing.

08:13.660 --> 08:14.710
Go on! Go on! Go on! Go on!

08:15.290 --> 08:17.420
They sure have a strange conversation,
those two.

08:17.660 --> 08:19.060
Then I guess I'll try it.

08:20.030 --> 08:22.430
Don't tell me!
She can't possibly laugh with that face...

08:32.340 --> 08:33.270
She laughed!

08:33.340 --> 08:35.170
She laughed, but her facial expression
hasn't changed one bit!

08:36.580 --> 08:37.240
How was that?

08:39.380 --> 08:40.310
You really make me laugh!

08:40.420 --> 08:42.010
That was so strange!

08:46.220 --> 08:47.850
They're having a friendly duet.

08:48.320 --> 08:50.190
This isn't strange. It's scary!

08:59.070 --> 09:01.200
Oh, Weda!

09:01.400 --> 09:04.500
Weda, listen to me. It's so horrible!

09:05.440 --> 09:07.430
What is it, so early in the morning?

09:08.080 --> 09:09.600
Oh, no!

09:09.680 --> 09:10.340
Who's that?

09:10.810 --> 09:12.750
Addy, one half of the Stupid Couple.

09:12.850 --> 09:15.220
I'm going to end the Stupid Couple today!

09:15.290 --> 09:16.750
I'm going to go through with my solo debut!

09:16.850 --> 09:17.950
Solo debut?

09:18.050 --> 09:21.420
I mean, Chet is so terrible!
Come on, listen to me!

09:21.520 --> 09:22.890
I don't want to hear it all that much.

09:23.590 --> 09:27.030
This morning, Chet made us coffee like he
always does...

09:32.470 --> 09:34.960
What's up with this coffee?
It's sweeter than usual.

09:36.010 --> 09:38.840
I put in two spoons of
sugar like I always do...

09:39.210 --> 09:42.870
No way! I always tell you to put in only one
spoonful of sugar!

09:43.480 --> 09:46.850
Oh, was that right?

09:49.520 --> 09:50.820
Oh, was that right?

09:50.890 --> 09:52.550
Can you believe it?

09:52.620 --> 09:54.560
It's almost been a year since we started
living together!

09:54.720 --> 09:57.220
He doesn't understand one thing about me!

10:00.560 --> 10:01.500
Addy...

10:02.670 --> 10:03.360
Yes?

10:04.930 --> 10:05.590
Go home.

10:07.740 --> 10:09.100
I'm telling you to go home!

10:09.170 --> 10:11.660
I don't have time to listen to
stupid love stories!

10:11.910 --> 10:12.970
Hey?

10:17.250 --> 10:18.870
Mom, was that all right?

10:19.320 --> 10:20.750
Get the salt! The salt to purify this place!

10:30.860 --> 10:33.730
Laugh during tough times. When you're sad,
that's the time to laugh.

10:33.830 --> 10:35.350
Laugh away and blow it all off.

10:35.470 --> 10:36.360
Now, laugh.

10:41.840 --> 10:43.700
You're laughing at someone else's pain!

10:43.770 --> 10:44.970
No, that's not what she means...

10:45.040 --> 10:46.980
It's just better to laugh it off
than weep about it.

10:47.080 --> 10:48.170
Cruel! So cruel!

10:48.240 --> 10:50.580
This isn't something that
can be just laughed off!

10:51.350 --> 10:52.040
Addy!

10:53.720 --> 10:55.310
Addy, I've been looking for you.

10:55.750 --> 10:57.520
W-What are you here for?

10:57.590 --> 10:59.050
It's all over between us!

10:59.360 --> 11:00.080
That can't be!

11:00.160 --> 11:02.220
Are we going to end it all
over a cup of coffee?

11:02.590 --> 11:03.850
I don't want to listen to your excuses.

11:03.930 --> 11:05.220
Go away somewhere!

11:05.730 --> 11:06.490
Addy!

11:06.730 --> 11:09.530
I thought that we knew everything about
each other!

11:10.030 --> 11:12.630
That's right!
I was only a passing fling for you!

11:12.700 --> 11:14.370
I'm going to break up with you!

11:14.370 --> 11:14.540
What are these two doing?

11:14.540 --> 11:14.570
What are these two doing?

11:14.570 --> 11:15.870
It's impossible that you were only a passing
fling for me!
What are these two doing?

11:15.870 --> 11:16.040
It's impossible that you were only a passing
fling for me!

11:16.040 --> 11:17.800
It's impossible that you were only a passing
fling for me!
As you can tell, they're having a fight.

11:17.870 --> 11:18.530
Addy!

11:18.610 --> 11:19.700
I will never forgive you!

11:21.010 --> 11:22.570
I have a hangover, you know.

11:23.510 --> 11:25.340
They're so noisy that I can't go to sleep.

11:28.580 --> 11:31.490
They have a quarrel at least once a month
over the stupidest things.

11:31.590 --> 11:35.050
But, with those god-awful saccharine lines
that Chet spits out, they make up in no time.

11:36.360 --> 11:40.020
Addy, if you're saying that I don't have
enough love for you, I'll try even harder.

11:40.630 --> 11:41.220
Oh, here it comes.

11:41.530 --> 11:45.400
So can you believe in my love
a little bit more?

11:45.800 --> 11:46.390
Please?

11:47.370 --> 11:48.430
Chet...

11:49.270 --> 11:50.570
I'm sorry, Chet!

11:51.040 --> 11:53.630
I, I...

11:54.040 --> 11:54.700
It's all right.

11:55.040 --> 11:56.510
You don't need to say a thing.

11:56.810 --> 11:57.710
Chet...

11:59.750 --> 12:03.210
You're right.
They always make up with those lines of his.

12:03.720 --> 12:07.090
Well, it's best to not have any arguments...

12:07.820 --> 12:11.320
But sometimes, it might be necessary in
order to get to know each other better.

12:21.770 --> 12:23.640
Heh, well said.

12:24.310 --> 12:26.330
The more quarrels you have, the closer your
relationship is.

12:26.410 --> 12:27.500
Y-You know...

12:27.610 --> 12:29.310
We don't have that kind of relationship!

12:29.380 --> 12:31.010
Now now, you'll be late for school.

12:32.920 --> 12:34.580
Oh, no! Let's go, Guu!

12:41.720 --> 12:42.820
All right, it's decided.

12:44.330 --> 12:45.920
Let's have a quarrel today.

12:50.500 --> 12:51.760
Somehow we made it!

12:52.200 --> 12:53.230
Morning, sir!

12:53.300 --> 12:54.530
Oh, morning!

12:57.910 --> 13:00.670
Teacher, listen to me! Haré is so terrible!

13:01.740 --> 13:03.840
What's wrong?
Did you have a fight with Haré?

13:04.250 --> 13:05.480
A fight??

13:05.920 --> 13:06.950
Oh, so that's what she meant...

13:06.950 --> 13:07.520
What, what, what's going on?
Oh, so that's what she meant...

13:07.520 --> 13:08.450
What, what, what's going on?

13:08.550 --> 13:11.280
Haré... Haré is so mean!

13:11.850 --> 13:12.910
Eh? Haré is?

13:13.690 --> 13:14.990
What did Haré do?

13:15.630 --> 13:16.610
What did he do?

13:16.760 --> 13:19.520
Well, I mean, Haré did
something terrible to you, right?

13:22.670 --> 13:25.760
Idiot, you can't get away with making up a
fight that doesn't have a cause!

13:27.170 --> 13:28.430
I can't say it!

13:30.270 --> 13:32.540
What, you can't tell us? Did he do something
that you can't talk about?

13:32.680 --> 13:35.410
What!? She avoided the problem that way?

13:35.710 --> 13:37.680
Hey, Haré! What did you do to Guu?

13:37.750 --> 13:38.740
I haven't done anything!

13:38.950 --> 13:41.140
Would she cry this much
if you didn't do anything?

13:41.220 --> 13:43.240
When I say I didn't do anything,
I mean I didn't do anything!

13:43.920 --> 13:46.860
Oh, I thought that we knew everything about
each other...

13:48.960 --> 13:50.430
This line... Could it be?

13:50.490 --> 13:52.690
I was only a passing fling for you!

13:52.800 --> 13:55.160
I was only a passing fling for you!

13:55.630 --> 13:57.570
That's what Addy was saying,
down to the last word!

13:57.670 --> 13:59.330
I'm going to break up with you!

13:59.570 --> 14:01.540
I don't know what's been going on,
but this is terrible!

14:01.840 --> 14:03.270
Haré, unlike how he looks...

14:03.740 --> 14:05.300
...sure makes girls cry.

14:05.810 --> 14:08.040
Y-You know, this irritates me!
Take it all back!

14:08.510 --> 14:11.040
I thought that we knew everything about
each other...

14:11.110 --> 14:13.010
I was only a passing fling for you!

14:13.120 --> 14:14.710
And that's enough out of you, get it?

14:14.780 --> 14:15.310
Kya!

14:15.380 --> 14:16.280
None of that "kya" thing!

14:16.490 --> 14:18.450
Come over here! We're going to talk it out!

14:19.160 --> 14:20.380
Haré, where are you going?

14:21.090 --> 14:23.680
Hey, don't you have to go after them,
as their teacher?

14:25.530 --> 14:26.050
Hey!

14:27.960 --> 14:30.130
I'm asking you,
don't you have to go after them?

14:31.130 --> 14:33.070
Sure, I'll go after them.

14:34.000 --> 14:34.990
Hey!

14:36.470 --> 14:37.460
Arguments are bad!

14:37.610 --> 14:41.170
Haré, Guu, if you talk it out...

14:41.910 --> 14:43.570
...you can understand each oth... er...

14:52.460 --> 14:54.750
Now, will you tell me exactly what you're
thinking by doing this?

14:55.090 --> 14:56.520
I'm going to break up with you!

14:57.160 --> 14:59.590
Now, that's enough of that!
You're getting me irritated! Stop it!

15:00.760 --> 15:02.200
I'm going to break up with you!

15:03.070 --> 15:04.830
This in itself is really irritating...

15:05.070 --> 15:07.730
In the first place, what you're doing can't be
considered an argument!

15:07.800 --> 15:09.430
It's not that I'm at fault for anything!

15:09.510 --> 15:12.670
You're just reciting Addy's lines!

15:15.240 --> 15:18.040
I thought that we knew everything about
each other...

15:18.150 --> 15:19.940
Hey, you're going back a few lines there!
Your lines!

15:21.320 --> 15:24.720
Can it be? She might not stop until all the
lines are out on the table?

15:24.820 --> 15:26.550
Wait! You've got to be kidding!

15:26.720 --> 15:29.280
If you're saying that I don't have enough love
for you, I'll try even harder.

15:29.860 --> 15:33.060
So can you believe in my love a little bit
more?

15:34.630 --> 15:38.070
I was only a passing fling for you!
I'm going to break up with you!

15:38.200 --> 15:39.630
She's repeating herself again.

15:39.700 --> 15:41.260
So I have to say it, don't I...

15:42.710 --> 15:43.970
Dammit!

15:46.710 --> 15:49.680
I-If you're saying that I don't have enough
love for you, I'll try even harder.

15:49.780 --> 15:53.370
So can you believe in my love a little bit
more?

15:55.220 --> 15:56.910
Oh, and we make up.

15:59.960 --> 16:01.290
Oh, I'm sorry...

16:02.120 --> 16:03.750
I didn't mean to listen in on you...

16:05.900 --> 16:09.260
I didn't know that your relationship had gone
that far already...

16:10.270 --> 16:13.100
Geez! This is almost exactly the response
that I expected out of you, Marie!

16:13.840 --> 16:16.330
Oh no, I've been crying, haven't I...

16:16.640 --> 16:20.200
I'm sorry. I'm sure it only troubles you for me
to be crying like this.

16:20.310 --> 16:22.540
Hey, Marie, come back!

16:22.610 --> 16:25.270
Can you actually look at reality for a bit!

16:25.380 --> 16:28.020
I told you the other day, but there's nothing
between me and Guu!

16:28.020 --> 16:30.710
That line was me just playing along with her
little game...

16:31.390 --> 16:32.850
No way! You were just playing!

16:33.660 --> 16:34.880
Do you go along with it again!

16:35.120 --> 16:38.290
It's all right, you don't need to worry about
me anymore...

16:38.790 --> 16:39.690
Hey, Marie!

16:39.800 --> 16:42.090
Ma... rie.

16:43.070 --> 16:44.660
Looks like she's having a tough time...

16:45.600 --> 16:46.120
Guess I'll go home.

16:46.200 --> 16:47.530
Hey! What's up with that!?

16:47.640 --> 16:49.230
Whose fault do you think all of this is!?

16:49.340 --> 16:50.000
Come on!

16:50.410 --> 16:51.840
Take responsibility for all of it!

16:51.910 --> 16:53.400
GUU!

16:54.840 --> 16:57.510
Guu is really strange.

16:57.610 --> 16:58.910
She's insane. She's not normal.

16:59.010 --> 17:03.140
I thought she was
laughing her head off yesterday,
but today she cries and has a fit with some
strange quarrel that I don't understand.

17:03.220 --> 17:06.190
Geez, and because of that, Marie has a huge
misunderstanding...

17:06.360 --> 17:08.480
Haré, you like Marie, don't you.

17:09.330 --> 17:10.920
I like her. In the normal sense.

17:11.130 --> 17:12.460
Wow, you're honest.

17:12.760 --> 17:16.790
The fact that Marie has this
misunderstanding didn't shock me at all.

17:17.470 --> 17:21.930
But, more than that, I can't stand the
misunderstanding itself - that I like Guu!

17:22.400 --> 17:23.270
Oh, no...

17:23.370 --> 17:27.000
Everyone in my class has that
misunderstanding! It's the worst! The worst!

17:28.110 --> 17:29.440
Is it the worst?

17:29.580 --> 17:30.440
It's the worst!

17:32.250 --> 17:34.050
That's a huge shock...

17:34.650 --> 17:36.520
There, there. He's so terrible.

17:36.790 --> 17:38.480
Don't say something
that you don't mean at all!

17:40.790 --> 17:43.120
And none of that look
makes it seem like you're hurt!

17:45.060 --> 17:45.690
I see...

17:47.830 --> 17:48.560
He said it's no good.

17:48.660 --> 17:50.930
I see, then how about you try to turn him on?

17:51.330 --> 17:53.030
M-Mom...

17:53.200 --> 17:54.930
Just kidding about that.

17:55.240 --> 17:58.170
Have some shrimp au gratin
and think about other things...

18:00.340 --> 18:05.010
Such misunderstandings can be reconciled if
you explain the situation properly to each
and every person.

18:05.380 --> 18:06.140
You think so?

18:06.320 --> 18:07.650
It's all right, you'll be fine.

18:07.880 --> 18:10.720
Hey, you need to help me get rid of this
misunderstanding.

18:10.850 --> 18:13.290
In the first place, it's all because of you!

18:13.460 --> 18:14.050
Got that?

18:14.420 --> 18:15.320
Yeah!

18:17.260 --> 18:18.990
Mom, I'm going to school now!

18:19.830 --> 18:21.890
Already? You're early today.

18:22.230 --> 18:24.500
I mean I have to talk out this
misunderstanding with everyone.

18:24.700 --> 18:25.790
Well, let's go, Guu.

18:27.270 --> 18:28.240
I'm on my way!

18:28.400 --> 18:29.840
Oh, before that.

18:31.710 --> 18:33.730
Your "be careful" smooch!

18:35.780 --> 18:38.470
You usually don't kiss your 10-year-old son!

18:39.080 --> 18:40.450
Geez, Mom!

18:40.620 --> 18:42.780
Here, a smooch for Guu-chan, too!

18:44.090 --> 18:45.950
Weda, you always smooch...

18:46.590 --> 18:47.520
What's a smooch?

18:47.760 --> 18:50.250
A greeting! A kiss of greeting!

18:50.360 --> 18:51.950
This is proper manners.

18:52.090 --> 18:54.590
It's common sense to kiss with feeling!

18:54.760 --> 18:55.860
It's very normal!

18:55.930 --> 18:57.590
Guu, hurry up! Let's go!

18:59.000 --> 19:00.660
Don't you dare do anything strange today.

19:02.370 --> 19:02.960
Normal...

19:03.040 --> 19:04.730
That's right. Normal is best.

19:09.080 --> 19:10.340
Oh, morning, Marie.

19:10.410 --> 19:11.340
About yesterday...

19:13.450 --> 19:14.110
Morning!

19:18.190 --> 19:19.810
Guu, just what was that!?

19:19.890 --> 19:20.690
A little greeting.

19:20.920 --> 19:22.290
You don't need to smooch in a greeting.

19:22.560 --> 19:24.390
Weda said it was common sense,
that it was normal.

19:25.160 --> 19:28.430
Of course, it might be normal for Mom,
but for regular people...

19:31.570 --> 19:32.430
Morning!

19:35.040 --> 19:35.900
Morning.

19:37.410 --> 19:38.430
There's a reason behind this...

19:38.510 --> 19:40.580
My mom always kisses when she says good
morning and stuff...

19:40.580 --> 19:41.670
You know in other words, a morning
smooch?

19:41.980 --> 19:43.210
Hey, are you listening?

19:44.250 --> 19:46.870
Gupta? Uighur?

19:47.520 --> 19:48.280
Marie?

19:48.980 --> 19:52.250
What should I do?
I need to make Guu stop kissing...

19:52.660 --> 19:56.220
But, how can I get rid of the "common
sense" that Mom fed into her?

19:56.290 --> 19:58.850
That's right! At times like this, I need to have
our teacher scold her!

19:59.400 --> 20:01.630
Guu, don't you move!
I'm going to bring our teacher right over!

20:03.070 --> 20:03.930
Teacher!

20:04.270 --> 20:06.860
A kiss said Guu to hello...
uh, that's not what I mean...

20:06.940 --> 20:08.100
What, what's wrong?

20:08.200 --> 20:11.430
Just that mom's common sense and the
everyday person's common sense is
different.

20:11.540 --> 20:12.910
I want you to tell her that!

20:13.410 --> 20:14.930
What are you talking about?

20:19.450 --> 20:20.640
It's too late...

20:21.680 --> 20:23.020
What's up with this?

20:23.420 --> 20:24.320
Hello.

20:29.460 --> 20:32.190
Geez! Nobody is moving now because of
pure shock!

20:32.260 --> 20:33.690
Guu, do something!

20:39.440 --> 20:40.600
Oh, Guu...

20:41.240 --> 20:43.170
My first kiss...

20:43.310 --> 20:46.210
I indirectly kissed Gupta...

20:48.680 --> 20:49.580
It's a nightmare...

20:49.810 --> 20:51.370
She just meant it as a simple greeting.

20:51.450 --> 20:52.680
So, guys, don't worry about it.

20:52.750 --> 20:53.770
What I'm telling you is true!

20:53.850 --> 20:55.840
Come on, guys!

21:02.990 --> 21:03.720
Morning!

21:11.670 --> 21:13.460
Laugh during tough times.

21:13.870 --> 21:15.670
When you're sad, that's the time to laugh.

21:15.770 --> 21:17.830
Laugh away and blow it all off.

22:34.850 --> 22:35.580
NEXT EPISODE

22:35.580 --> 22:37.150
Oh, I feel horrible... Is it a cold?

22:37.150 --> 22:38.950
I'm so stupid for catching a cold
in the middle of the jungle...

22:38.950 --> 22:40.420
I'm gonna go to the
nurse's office so I can rest a bit.

22:40.420 --> 22:41.760
Eh? We have a new doctor in the nurse's office?

22:41.760 --> 22:44.590
He came from the city?
Will he let me rest? What's he like?

22:44.590 --> 22:45.860
What, what? Uh-huh. Eh? He's scary?

22:45.860 --> 22:48.000
You suddenly get splashed with antiseptic,
hit with a barrage or syringes...

22:48.000 --> 22:50.000
and end up half-dead just because he
doesn't like your eyes?

22:50.000 --> 22:52.070
Wow, he's crazy and mad and dangerous...

22:52.070 --> 22:54.640
But, apparently he's nice to girls, or rather,
he gets way too friendly.

22:54.640 --> 22:57.410
Isn't that called sexual harassment? He
seems like a really bad guy.

22:57.410 --> 22:59.880
Eh? Mom, you know this new doctor? Why?

22:59.880 --> 23:01.780
The Doctor is in the Nurse's office

23:01.780 --> 23:03.850
The Doctor is in the Nurse's office

23:03.850 --> 23:04.810
The Doctor is in the Nurse's office
